{"title":"Trivia Night @Stout Irish Pub - Tuesday October 6th, 2026 at 6:45 PM","startsAt":"2026-10-06T18:45:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-06T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Let's get together for trivia and toasting, while tasting some delicious food!\nCome join us for an exciting Trivia Night on **Tuesday**, October 6th, 2026 at **6:45 AM (sharp)** at Stout Irish Pub, The venue is known for it's authentic Irish pub experience and hospitality. A fun and interactive night with great food, attentive staff and general trivia. There is a **minimum** **$10 per person** spend on food / drinks. Click [here](https://www.stoutirishpub.ca/menu) for a link to the food menu and [here](https://www.stoutirishpub.ca/drink-menu) for a link to the drink menu. Meet friends and make some new ones while enjoying a great night out! Each participant will cover their own food and drink costs. **The venue requests to please arrive on time.**\n**There is a non-refundable / non-transferable $5.00 cover fee** to attend this group event. This charge will reserve your spot, help with group costs and hopefully minimize no shows. **Payment of the $5 cover charge is due by TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 29th, 2026.** After this date, non payment of the cover fee will result in the Member's name being moved to the \"not going\" list so that those \"waitlisted\" have an opportunity to attend the event.\nIn consideration of others, if you are not able to attend, please advise 48 hours prior to the event to allow other people on the waitlist to have your spot. No shows and less than 48 hours notice of non-attendance will be noted. 2 or more such occurrences will unfortunately lead to removal from the group. Thank you all for your understanding and consideration.\nHere are the details for the $5.00 e-transfer - E-mail - [weekendbrunchover50@hotmail.com](http://weekendbrunchover50@hotmail.com/), Security Question - What is the the event? **trivia**\nHope to see you there!","venue":{"name":"Stout Irish pub","address":"221 Carlton St., Toronto, ON M5A 2L2, Canada,, Toronto","lat":43.663795,"lng":-79.368904,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Weekend Brunch and More for Ladies Over 50 (Ladies Only)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/6/5/highres_536043173.jpeg"}